  words:
  - grasshopper
  - grasshoppers
  info: 'A grasshopper is an insect belonging to the order Orthoptera. They typically
    live above ground in grassy or vegetated habitats and have strong hind legs that
    allow them to jump great distances, which is reflected in their name. Some grasshopper
    species, known as locusts, can change color and form swarms. They are among the
    more ancient groups of insects, appearing around 250 million years ago and predating
    grasses by roughly 180 million years.


    Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grasshopper '
  image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: e9ec9deefca66e1498bbce3f867fda2a, type: 3}
